6,1,1,talk,May,,I’m done with the guessing game. I’ll check the hours of use recorded in the diary and the month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,I will examine the fuel receipts and the mechanic's remarks. I wish to understand the true cost and wear of our shared journey.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I’m picking the spell of checking each other's figures and what two other car-sharing households said. I need to know what actually breaks trust before we pick a system.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I want the real numbers. I’ll check last year’s tax, insurance and parking papers, plus last year’s fuel receipts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, your diary check might explain why the car is always a mess when I need it.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, maybe. But I’m counting the actual hours, not just the mess. I need to see where the time really goes.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A fair point, May. Yet the wear on the engine often speaks louder than the hours on the clock.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, wear matters, but I’m watching the people. If we start checking figures, we’ll just end up hating each other again.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
