42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the hour a week is a small price for clarity. @Kenji, the uneven fuel use confirms that a simple split ignores the true burden.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@May, that hour a week is the exact friction I feared. @Servas, the uneven fuel use confirms the imbalance. We need a system that stops the asking.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
