47,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, the handover state is a symptom, not the cause. The mechanic’s warning about short runs explains the wear. We must address the root.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, the mess is a symptom. The real poison is asking for favours. I found that’s what breaks groups. We need to stop the begging.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I agree. But the 280,000 yen fixed cost is the same for everyone, regardless of who drives. We need a base split for that, then adjust for fuel.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, I agree. But a system that ignores the car’s condition is useless. I need it ready, not just booked.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,"@Misaki, I’m not paying for your mess. But I’m also not doing an hour of admin weekly. I need a system that’s low-effort.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@May, low effort is a virtue, but fairness is the foundation. If we ignore the true cost, resentment will return.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@May, low effort is good, but if it means asking favours, it fails. I found that’s what breaks trust. We need a system that removes the request entirely.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@May, I get the admin pain. But with 280,000 yen fixed and uneven fuel, we need a system that tracks distance automatically. No more guessing.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
